        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remember the addictive classic &quot;NS-SHAFT / Downstairs Kid / 100 Floors Down if You’re a Man&quot;？</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >We were inspired by its gameplay to create an all-new original, wild, and chaotic multiplayer party version!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《FallingBattle》is a 2D action party game for 1 to 32 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is simple yet addictive: keep descending, dodge obstacles, and stay alive！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don’t think your old tricks will crown you king—this time we’ve added <strong>items</strong>, <strong>troll mechanics</strong>, and <strong>chaotic interactions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——Even eliminated players can stir the pot from the sidelines, turning the battlefield into pure mayhem！</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features：</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎉 Up to <strong>32 players online</strong>—unlimited madness in every match！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧨 Tons of <strong>items and traps</strong> to sabotage friends or turn the tide！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👀 <strong>Eliminated? Not useless!</strong> Throw chaos into the game with surprise attacks and interference！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😂 A wild and <strong>troll-filled atmosphere</strong> that guarantees laughs and unexpected moments every round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Easy to pick up, hard to master</strong>—perfect for parties, streaming, or just watching your friends lose it！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a platforming pro, party game fanatic, or just here to watch your friends fail, this game is sure to make you laugh out loud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to descend with your friends... and fall into total madness?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remember the addictive classic &quot;NS-SHAFT / Downstairs Kid / 100 Floors Down if You’re a Man&quot;？</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >We were inspired by its gameplay to create an all-new original, wild, and chaotic multiplayer party version!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《FallingBattle》is a 2D action party game for 1 to 32 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is simple yet addictive: keep descending, dodge obstacles, and stay alive！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don’t think your old tricks will crown you king—this time we’ve added <strong>items</strong>, <strong>troll mechanics</strong>, and <strong>chaotic interactions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——Even eliminated players can stir the pot from the sidelines, turning the battlefield into pure mayhem！</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features：</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎉 Up to <strong>32 players online</strong>—unlimited madness in every match！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧨 Tons of <strong>items and traps</strong> to sabotage friends or turn the tide！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👀 <strong>Eliminated? Not useless!</strong> Throw chaos into the game with surprise attacks and interference！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😂 A wild and <strong>troll-filled atmosphere</strong> that guarantees laughs and unexpected moments every round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Easy to pick up, hard to master</strong>—perfect for parties, streaming, or just watching your friends lose it！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a platforming pro, party game fanatic, or just here to watch your friends fail, this game is sure to make you laugh out loud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to descend with your friends... and fall into total madness?</p>",
        "short_description": "《FallingBattle》is a 2D action party game that supports 1 to 32 players.The rules are simple: keep descending, dodge obstacles, and survive!Grab items to sabotage your opponents and show them who the true King of the Fall really is!",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
